DocsifyTemplate
https://github.com/Kiri23/DocsifyTemplate

This repo reuses code of the summarize-pr skill:

  MeLlamoPablo/skills, skills/summarize-pr
  https://github.com/MeLlamoPablo/skills/tree/72199a8/skills/summarize-pr
  commit 72199a8 ("summarize-pr: write the page comment marker as `//! <text>`")

The upstream repo has no LICENSE file. Its author gave Christian Nogueras permission to reuse the
code (by Twitter, 2026-11). This notice keeps the attribution with the code.

What comes from there:

- packages/docs-site/pr/summarize-pr/template.html, check.mjs and shown-lines.mjs: copies of the
  upstream files. check.mjs changes one line: it finds template.html in its own folder.
- packages/docs-site/components/pr/: the views of the summary blocks (decision, diff, chart, tests,
  terms...) reuse the template's CSS and its module script (hidden blocks, page comments, the diff
  viewer and chart options, the term tooltip), adapted to the site's theme and to Preact.
- packages/docs-site/docs/prs/*.html: pages that summarize-pr made.
